        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 1260",
        "original_text": "| HTTP 429 | rate limit | Provider Job | Retryable | 可 | Provider Retry-After優先 | Circuit状態とBudget再検査後再試行 | 原則不要 | §2.5 |"
