        "semantic_kind": "table_row",
        "source_locator": "SDD line 1261",
        "original_text": "| Provider 5xx連続 | 外部障害 | Adapter利用Job | ADAPTER_DEGRADED | 可 | Circuit Breakerで一定時間通常Job停止 | next_allowed_at後にhealth再評価 | 継続時確認 | §2.5 |"
